From 4386374031972ade1cf993e10a7758a4424a3ab8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 14:07:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WiFi button: wait for a WiFi join before the Headunit Server
 scan

When the unit is not on a WiFi network yet, the WiFi button now triggers
WiFi scans (to speed up auto-join of the phone hotspot), waits up to 60s
for a WiFi network and only then starts the one-shot Headunit Server
discovery. Pressing the button again while waiting cancels the wait.

